   "availability": "in_stock",
   "description": "Presenting the return of the DG013. De Guzman & Co.'s most popular release is back and updated to fit with the brand's new ethos of innovation and value-proposition. Returning with a new colorway, new sunburst finishing, re-interpreted signature hands, and now with an innovative hybrid rubber-leather bracelet. Sportier than its last release, the DG013 now comes in a hybrid waterproof leather/rubber bracelet. Seemingly made of pure leather, the DG013 hybrid bracelet is made with a rubber bracelet base with a waterproof treated leather strap stitched at the top. This gives the illusion of a full leather strap, while keeping the watch water resistant from the case to the bracelet: Keeping in theme with the sportier nature of this series.",
